{"quest_id": 8739, "name": "古の盟約", "description": "王子たちは雪原王を決める戦いに挑む！\n＜魔力嵐(弱)：出撃時の初期HP減少(小)\n　爆風範囲、魔法ダメージが減少＞\n上級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv10）", "modifier_notes": ["魔力嵐(弱)：出撃時の初期HP減少(小)\n　爆風範囲、魔法ダメージが減少"], "event": "雪原に立つ新たなる王者", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920239, "map_no": 7301, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 40, "capacity": 8, "modifiers": [{"kind": "term", "influence": 50, "params": [80]}, {"kind": "term", "influence": 22, "params": [80]}, {"kind": "term", "influence": 9, "params": [20], "expression": "!IsPlayerSupportUnit();", "expression_human": "it is not a borrowed support unit"}], "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 9, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1800, "attack": 370, "base_hp": 1800, "base_attack": 370, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 130, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 77, "move_speed": 1800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2101264, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 228, "global_id": 227, "spawn_sec": 47}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 14, "form_count": 2, "hp": 4000, "attack": 350, "base_hp": 4000, "base_attack": 350, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 5, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 25, "attack_interval": 175, "move_speed": 1200.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2165088, "race_id": 12, "change_to": 2, "change_condition": 3, "master_id": 39284, "global_id": 12901, "to_condition": 3, "to_global_id": 12902, "spawn_sec": 64}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 4000, "attack": 350, "base_hp": 4000, "base_attack": 350, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 5, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 25, "attack_interval": 175, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2165104, "race_id": 12, "master_id": 39285, "global_id": 12902, "from_condition": 3}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 15, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3200, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 3200, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 80, "attack_range": 210, "attack_speed": 37, "attack_wait": 35, "attack_interval": 139, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2165136, "race_id": 12, "special_effect_id": 234, "missile_id": 1411, "missile": {"speed": 5.0}, "master_id": 39287, "global_id": 12904, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 71}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 30000, "attack": 850, "base_hp": 30000, "base_attack": 850, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 400, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 50, "attack_interval": 144, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2165056, "race_id": 12, "master_id": 39282, "global_id": 12899, "spawn_sec": 96}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 14000, "attack": 450, "base_hp": 14000, "base_attack": 450, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 5, "attack_range": 240, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 25, "attack_interval": 119, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2165120, "race_id": 12, "special_effect_id": 288, "missile_id": 1411, "missile": {"speed": 5.0}, "master_id": 39286, "global_id": 12903, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 96}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 8, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3000, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_range": 60, "attack_speed": 10, "attack_wait": 35, "attack_interval": 91, "move_speed": 1800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2162320, "race_id": 11, "special_effect_id": 229, "missile_id": 8, "missile": {"speed": 6.0}, "master_id": 38997, "global_id": 12614, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 122}, {"enemy_id": 8, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["ステルス"], "hp": 3000, "attack": 350, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 350, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 180, "magic_defense": 5, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 119, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2163232, "change_to": 8, "change_condition": 1, "master_id": 39091, "global_id": 12708, "variants": [{"tags": ["ステルス"], "hp": 3000, "attack": 350, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 350, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 180, "magic_defense": 5, "attack_range": 40, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 59, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2163232, "missile_id": 483, "missile": {"on_hit": {"kind": "攻撃遅延", "duration_f": 140, "attack_interval_f": 140, "effect_name": "HitEffectSlow"}}, "master_id": 39092, "global_id": 12709, "ranged": true}], "spawn_sec": 154}], "popups": ["　　【魔力嵐(弱)】\n・ユニット配置時の\n　初期HPが少し減少\n\n・味方の魔法攻撃による\n　ダメージが減少\n\n・敵味方の爆風範囲が減少", "　　　悪天候：吹雪\n\n・敵の『移動速度』減少\n・敵味方の『射程』減少\n・一部の味方の性能上昇\n・一部の敵味方は影響を受けない\n・影響を受けない敵の『攻撃力』上昇", "スノーワームから攻撃を受けると、\n攻撃後の待ち時間が増加します。\n\n麻痺などの状態異常と同じく\n特定のユニットで軽減、\n無効化が可能です。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "アヴリック", "text": "――さぁついに始まります、雪原王決定戦！\n前回開催からすでに三百年！\n当時の記録も何も残っていない愉快な状況です！", "face": "u2443a1"}, {"name": "フィノーラ", "text": "アヴリック、何してるんだ……？", "face": "u2441a1"}, {"name": "アヴリック", "text": "何って実況ですよ実況！\nこういう大会には実況が必要だって、\nとある竜人の里で小耳に挟んだので！", "face": "u2443a1"}, {"name": "フィノーラ", "text": "まぁ、うん、アヴリックが楽しいならそれでいいか。", "face": "u2441a1"}, {"name": "アヴリック", "text": "おぉ！　さっそく選手入場です！\n最初は雪羊の里、ユキヒツジの族長！", "face": "u2443a1"}, {"name": "ユキヒツジの族長", "text": "メェェェェッ！！\n南の人間が雪原王にふさわしいかどうか、\n我が最強のブーメランで確かめてやるメーッ！！", "face": "l4bb9b565c5f2"}, {"name": "クルーナ", "text": "ユキヒツジの戦士は雪原でも指折りの狩人！\n草食とは思えない、獰猛な戦いをするよ！", "face": "u2613a1"}, {"name": "アヴリック", "text": "解説のクルーナさん、ありがとうございます！\nおぉっと、次はセイウチの里の族長が入場だー！", "face": "u2443a1"}, {"name": "セイウチの族長", "text": "本当はこういう戦いは得意ではないのだが……。\nやるからには本気で行かせてもらうぜ？", "face": "lc67f09778af3"}, {"name": "クルーナ", "text": "セイウチの一族は温厚で優しい一族。\nでも有り余る筋肉は、戦闘になったら脅威だよ！", "face": "u2613a1"}, {"name": "アヴリック", "text": "配下のペンギン戦士たちにも要注目！\n可愛い……連れて帰りたい……。", "face": "u2443a1"}, {"name": "セイウチの族長", "text": "うちの村民を誘拐してもらっちゃ困るぜ、お嬢ちゃん。", "face": "lc67f09778af3"}, {"name": "アヴリック", "text": "はっ、すみません……。\nそして最後に登場！　我らが王子ーッ！！", "face": "u2443a1"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………！（ふんす）", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "アヴリック", "text": "今ここに！\n雪原王決定戦、予選のゴングが鳴り響くぅー！！", "face": "u2443a1"}, {"name": "アヴリック", "text": "いざ、試合開始！", "face": "u2443a1"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "セイウチの族長", "text": "よぉユキヒツジの。\n南の戦士ってのもやるもんだな。", "face": "lc67f09778af3"}, {"name": "ユキヒツジの族長", "text": "セイウチの……。\nそうか、お前が族長になっていたのかメー。", "face": "l4bb9b565c5f2"}, {"name": "セイウチの族長", "text": "最後にあったのは十年も前か。\n狭間の雪原じゃ、\n互いの里の行き来すら命がけだからなァ。", "face": "lc67f09778af3"}, {"name": "ユキヒツジの族長", "text": "それで、お前はやつをどう見る。", "face": "l4bb9b565c5f2"}, {"name": "セイウチの族長", "text": "南の大地……王国の里だったか？\n王子ってことは次期族長、か。", "face": "lc67f09778af3"}, {"name": "セイウチの族長", "text": "なぁ、ユキヒツジの。\nたぶんオレたちは、同じことを考えてるぜ？", "face": "lc67f09778af3"}, {"name": "ユキヒツジの族長", "text": "メー。違いないメー。王子よ、俺たちは――", "face": "l4bb9b565c5f2"}, {"name": "セイウチの族長", "text": "――てめぇを雪原王として認めるぜ！", "face": "lc67f09778af3"}, {"name": "ユキヒツジの族長", "text": "だが、準決勝の相手は\nとんでもねぇ奴が出てくるメー。\n俺たちに勝った男が負けるのは許さないメー。", "face": "l4bb9b565c5f2"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………（こくり）", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "アヴリック", "text": "予選第一回戦、勝者は……王子ぃー！！\n素晴らしい戦いでした！", "face": "u2443a1"}]}], "active": true}